{"id":210,"date":"2020-06-29T20:08:25","date_gmt":"2020-06-29T20:08:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/me.sherwood.k12.or.us\/?page_id=210"},"modified":"2025-12-15T10:32:12","modified_gmt":"2025-12-15T18:32:12","slug":"media-center","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/me.sherwood.k12.or.us\/resources\/media-center\/","title":{"rendered":"Media Center"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color has-medium-font-size\" style=\"color:#a30086;line-height:1.5\">Caryn Bussanich<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0e21f0;line-height:0.7\">Media Center Educational Coordinator<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#3404cf;line-height:0.5\">cbussanich@sherwood.k12.or.us<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#2d3ce0;line-height:0.8\">503-825-5309 !<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">                    <em><strong>&#8220;Keep Reading. It&#8217;s one of the most marvelous adventures that anyone can have.&#8221;  -Lloyd Alex<\/strong><\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>BOOKS &amp; BRICKS YOUTH WINTER READING PROGRAM<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>December 20, 2025 &#8211; January 9, 2026   Return your completed Reading Log to the Middleton Library<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2025\/12\/image-1-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1181\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2025\/12\/image-1-1024x1024.png 1024w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2025\/12\/image-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2025\/12\/image-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2025\/12\/image-1-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2025\/12\/image-1.png 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 250px) 100vw, 250px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Look below to print Reading Logs!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1z45YCcSCf259bIJF04Z0shblaCbVKbaN\/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">2025\/26 Books &amp; Bricks Winter Reading Log<\/a><a href=\"\"><\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"\"><\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0.7\"><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/search.follettsoftware.com\/metasearch\/ui\/2934\" data-type=\"https:\/\/search.follettsoftware.com\/metasearch\/ui\/2934\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#db515b\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><strong>Destiny Library System<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"line-height:1.4\">Click here to login and to browse are collection<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/search.follettsoftware.com\/metasearch\/ui\/2934\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"https:\/\/search.follettsoftware.com\/metasearch\/ui\/2934 noopener noreferrer\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/follettdestiny.jpeg\" alt=\"Follett Destiny Library Catalog logo\" class=\"wp-image-357\" width=\"472\" height=\"148\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/follettdestiny.jpeg 401w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/follettdestiny-300x94.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 472px) 100vw, 472px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\" \/>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/departments\/teaching-and-learning\/media-center-library-services\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SSD Library Media Center Policies<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/12\/images-3.jpg\" alt=\"red question mark\" class=\"wp-image-459\" width=\"115\" height=\"145\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0fb1f6;font-size:35px\"><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1ouk6TK0mPPxyMlpAYhy6gWoTW2FSWYdc\/view?usp=sharing\" data-type=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1ouk6TK0mPPxyMlpAYhy6gWoTW2FSWYdc\/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>How to put a book on hold video<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\" \/>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0.7\"><mark style=\"color:#1c07bc\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><a data-type=\"http:\/\/images.learn.follett.com\/Web\/FollettCorporation\/%7Bd437904c-13eb-4630-9af1-bc8e4fb9d237%7D_Getting-Started-with-eBooks-in-Universal-Search.pdf\" href=\"http:\/\/images.learn.follett.com\/Web\/FollettCorporation\/%7Bd437904c-13eb-4630-9af1-bc8e4fb9d237%7D_Getting-Started-with-eBooks-in-Universal-Search.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>eBooks<\/strong><\/a><\/mark><\/h1>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"http:\/\/images.learn.follett.com\/Web\/FollettCorporation\/%7Bd437904c-13eb-4630-9af1-bc8e4fb9d237%7D_Getting-Started-with-eBooks-in-Universal-Search.pdf\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/71KhneOm35L.png\" alt=\"iPhone with an eBook on it leaning up against a pile of books\" class=\"wp-image-382\" width=\"211\" height=\"211\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/71KhneOm35L.png 512w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/71KhneOm35L-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/71KhneOm35L-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 211px) 100vw, 211px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-css-opacity has-background is-style-wide\" style=\"background-color:#a30600;color:#a30600\" \/>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0.7\"><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.oregonbattleofthebooks.org\/\" data-type=\"https:\/\/www.oregonbattleofthebooks.org\/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#136b17\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><strong>Oregon Battle of the Books<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/h1>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.oregonbattleofthebooks.org\/\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/oregon-battle-of-the-books-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Oregon Battle of the Books logo\" class=\"wp-image-332\" width=\"267\" height=\"181\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/oregon-battle-of-the-books-logo.jpg 450w, https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/oregon-battle-of-the-books-logo-300x205.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 267px) 100vw, 267px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>2025 &#8211; 2026 OBOB Title List<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>3<sup>rd<\/sup>&nbsp;to 5<sup>th<\/sup>&nbsp;Grade Division<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><em>Better with Butter<\/em>&nbsp;by Victoria Piontek \u2013 ISBN 9781338662214<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>The City of Ember<\/em>&nbsp;by Jeanne DuPrau \u2013 ISBN 9780375822742<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>Elf Dog and Owl Head<\/em>&nbsp;by M. T. Anderson \u2013 ISBN 9781536235166<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>Escape from Mr. Lemoncello\u2019s Library<\/em>&nbsp;by Chris Grabenstein&nbsp; \u2013 ISBN 978059389720&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>Finding Langston<\/em>&nbsp;by Lesa Cline-Ransome \u2013 ISBN 9780823445820<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>Hatchet<\/em>&nbsp;by Gary Paulsen \u2013 ISBN 9780545462211<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>Inside Out and Back Again<\/em>&nbsp;by Thanhh\u00e0 L\u1ea1i \u2013 ISBN 9780061962790<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>Just Like Click<\/em>&nbsp;by Sandy Grubb \u2013 ISBN 9781646034390<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>The Lost Library<\/em>&nbsp;by Rebecca Stead and Wendy Mass \u2013 ISBN 9781250838834<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>The Million Dollar Race<\/em>&nbsp;by Matthew Ross Smith \u2013 ISBN 9781534420281<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>Number the Stars<\/em>&nbsp;by Lois Lowry \u2013 ISBN 9780547577098<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>Odder<\/em>&nbsp;by Katherine Applegate \u2013 ISBN 9781250147424<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>The&nbsp;Remarkable Rescue at Milkweed Meadow<\/em>&nbsp;by Elaine Dimopoulos \u2013 ISBN 9781623545857<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>The Secret Garden on 81st Street<\/em>&nbsp;by Ivy Noelle Weir and Amber Padilla \u2013 ISBN 9780316459709<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>Squished<\/em>&nbsp;by Megan Wagner Lloyd and Michelle Mee Nutter \u2013 ISBN 9781338568936<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><em>The Tail of Emily Windsnap<\/em>&nbsp;by Liz Kessler \u2013 ISBN 9780763660208<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/document\/d\/1a8qTnLmXalI-1TPiQ_zjzwQEmpSyNd4hJ2eWzYKBUFE\/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">OBOB Letter 2025 &#8211; 2026<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/document\/d\/13ULIx8khUlegL24-lIHyWqQlCEt3ZhUmGNuKFZmiy5E\/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Spanish OBOB Letter 2025 &#8211; 2026<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>**<\/strong>&nbsp;<strong>Information is from the Oregon Battle of the books website. **<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\" \/>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0a46c7;line-height:0.7\"><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/0B6E0-KoNd677SG8tOWtfaWx5WlFjbUw3emtRMnlkeXR2OFJj\/view?scrlybrkr=4c2d8d9d\" data-type=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/0B6E0-KoNd677SG8tOWtfaWx5WlFjbUw3emtRMnlkeXR2OFJj\/view?scrlybrkr=4c2d8d9d\"><span style=\"color:#0b7fb0\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><strong>Digital Citizenship<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/h1>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/digital_citizenship-1-768x438-1.png\" alt=\"Digital Citizenship logo\" class=\"wp-image-381\" width=\"282\" height=\"159\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\" \/>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0.7\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.storylineonline.net\/\" data-type=\"https:\/\/www.storylineonline.net\/\"><span style=\"color:#a30cef\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><strong>Storyline<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Storyline Online is available 24 hours a day for children, parents, caregivers and educators worldwide. Each book includes supplemental curriculum developed by a credentialed elementary educator, aiming to strengthen comprehension and verbal and written skills for English-language learners.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"168\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/story-line.jpg\" alt=\"Storyline Online logo\" class=\"wp-image-416\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\" \/>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\" style=\"line-height:0.7\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.tumblebooklibrary.com\/Default.aspx?ReturnUrl=%2f\" data-type=\"https:\/\/www.tumblebooklibrary.com\/Default.aspx?ReturnUrl=%2f\"><span style=\"color:#335538\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><strong>Tumble Books<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Watch, listen, and read along with animated picture books and e-books for new readers with&nbsp;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.tumblemobile.com\/autologin.aspx?UserID=9%2BKxCHgEs8fiRK48SFvwow%3D%3D\">Tumblebook Library<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>TumbleBooks e-books have several features to adapt the text for students who are struggling to learn to read and students with reading disabilities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>For example: Listen to the e-book as the text is highlighted, change the colors and contrast of text on the page, and change the font style and size.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.tumblebooklibrary.com\/auto_login.aspx?u=wccls&amp;p=sherwood\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click here to access TumbleBook Library.<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color\"><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/document\/d\/1thJqC5zSAKrknB9YGtiY90v8i0S51MmogcwRgyGwJtc\/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Click here for more information on using TumbleBook Library.<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.tumblebooklibrary.com\/Default.aspx?ReturnUrl=%2f\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"251\" height=\"90\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2020\/09\/tbl-logo.png\" alt=\"Tumble Book Library logo\" class=\"wp-image-340\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide\" \/>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-large-font-size has-text-color\" style=\"color:#040219\">Awards<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\"><strong><mark style=\"color:#454fbf\" class=\"has-inline-color\"><a data-type=\"http:\/\/www.ala.org\/alsc\/awardsgrants\/bookmedia\/caldecottmedal\/caldecottmedal\" href=\"http:\/\/www.ala.org\/alsc\/awardsgrants\/bookmedia\/caldecottmedal\/caldecottmedal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">2025 Caldecott Medal Winner<\/a><\/mark><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"273\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2025\/02\/image.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1099\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color has-large-font-size\">2025 Newbery Award Winnertt<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"197\" height=\"300\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwood.k12.or.us\/app\/uploads\/sites\/5\/2025\/02\/image-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1101\" \/><\/figure>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Caryn Bussanich Media Center Educational Coordinator cbussanich@sherwood.k12.or.us 503-825-5309 ! &#8220;Keep Reading. It&#8217;s one of the most marvelous adventures that anyone can have.&#8221; -Lloyd Alex BOOKS&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":24,"featured_media":0,"parent":208,"menu_order":30,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":[],"acf":[],"y